version: "1.0.2"
abstract: >
  Pre-registered measurements of the cost and friction of converting
  accumulated L2 USDC micropayment revenue into spendable fiat. The
  usdc-fiat-sweep-api experiment (v1.0.1) converted 8 tranches totaling
  $157.25908 USDC to USD via the Coinbase Advanced Trade convert API:
  the convert fee quoted and charged was $0.00, the realized fee was 0.00%,
  and the USD spread was 0% on every tranche from $1 to the full wallet
  balance; the only realized cost was Base gas (~$0.31). Figure 3 (fee
  decomposition) is intentionally absent because every cost component is
  zero.
keywords:
  - pre-registered-experiment
